WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.906 --> 00:00:05.050
- Beyonce's new clothing line, Ivy Park

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:07.505
has come under fire recently
after tabloid reports

00:00:07.505 --> 00:00:09.682
that the line was made
by workers in Sri Lanka,

00:00:09.682 --> 00:00:12.660
who were paid only $0.64 an hour.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.688
While Ivy Park has denied these claims,

00:00:14.688 --> 00:00:16.268
this left us wondering about the clothes

00:00:16.268 --> 00:00:17.932
we buy from the brands we love.

00:00:17.932 --> 00:00:19.892
What impact do our purchases have

00:00:19.892 --> 00:00:21.772
on the people who make our clothes

00:00:21.772 --> 00:00:23.948
and do we even know where
our clothes are made?

00:00:23.948 --> 00:00:25.133
Let's find out.

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:27.800
(playful music)

00:00:29.876 --> 00:00:32.143
Do you know where the clothes
that you're currently wearing,

00:00:32.143 --> 00:00:34.958
what country they were made in?

00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:36.730
- Uh, no, not offhand.

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:38.634
- I have no idea.

00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:39.786
- I have, I don't know.

00:00:39.786 --> 00:00:40.993
- I think Thailand and China.

00:00:40.993 --> 00:00:41.977
- Probably China.

00:00:41.977 --> 00:00:42.848
- China.

00:00:42.848 --> 00:00:43.852
- Maybe Thailand.

00:00:43.852 --> 00:00:44.748
- It's Indonesia.

00:00:44.748 --> 00:00:45.624
- USA.

00:00:45.624 --> 00:00:46.605
- China, China.

00:00:46.605 --> 00:00:47.672
- [Woman In Red] China.
- China.

00:00:47.672 --> 00:00:49.584
- It's probably made
in a sweatshop, right?

00:00:49.584 --> 00:00:50.864
That's what we're getting at?

00:00:50.864 --> 00:00:52.356
- Can we do some investigation?

00:00:52.356 --> 00:00:53.424
- I mean, sure.

00:00:53.424 --> 00:00:54.872
- Can I look at your tags, do you mind?

00:00:54.872 --> 00:00:56.187
It says made in Mexico.

00:00:56.187 --> 00:00:57.020
- Oh.

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:58.087
- Can I check your tag?

00:00:58.087 --> 00:00:59.323
Made in Pakistan.

00:00:59.323 --> 00:01:00.499
- Oh, Pakistan, okay.

00:01:00.499 --> 00:01:01.691
What about yours, what's it made from?

00:01:01.691 --> 00:01:02.695
- These are made in the US.

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.399
Made in California, USA on your shirt.

00:01:04.399 --> 00:01:05.232
- Yeah.

00:01:05.232 --> 00:01:06.302
- [Woman With Glasses] China.

00:01:06.302 --> 00:01:07.286
- Not surprising.

00:01:07.286 --> 00:01:08.158
Vietnam.

00:01:08.158 --> 00:01:09.438
- [Interviewer] Nicaragua

00:01:09.438 --> 00:01:10.334
- Nicaragua.

00:01:10.334 --> 00:01:11.297
- [Interviewer] Made in Vietnam.

00:01:11.297 --> 00:01:12.346
- This is Vietnam?

00:01:12.346 --> 00:01:13.425
- Made in Haiti.

00:01:13.425 --> 00:01:14.258
- Oh.

00:01:14.258 --> 00:01:16.204
- Oh, it says made in Russia.

00:01:16.204 --> 00:01:17.316
- In China.

00:01:17.316 --> 00:01:18.468
- In Pakistan.

00:01:18.468 --> 00:01:19.640
- Bangladesh.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:20.748
- El Salvador.

00:01:20.748 --> 00:01:21.622
- El Salvador.

00:01:21.622 --> 00:01:22.455
- Haiti.

00:01:22.455 --> 00:01:23.288
China, you're right.

00:01:23.288 --> 00:01:24.223
- All right.

00:01:24.223 --> 00:01:25.783
- [Black-Haired Woman] Made in China.

00:01:25.783 --> 00:01:27.039
- [Brunette Woman] Also made in China.

00:01:27.039 --> 00:01:27.915
- Mexico.

00:01:27.915 --> 00:01:28.748
- China.

00:01:28.748 --> 00:01:29.581
- Vietnam.

00:01:29.581 --> 00:01:30.790
- Made in the United States,

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:32.384
but that doesn't mean it was

00:01:32.384 --> 00:01:34.221
made in the United States either.

00:01:34.221 --> 00:01:35.776
- Yeah, you think so, why is that?

00:01:35.776 --> 00:01:38.482
Even if it says if it's
made in the United States?

00:01:38.482 --> 00:01:39.802
You don't believe it?

00:01:39.802 --> 00:01:40.850
- No.

00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:42.618
- What do you think you think?

00:01:42.618 --> 00:01:46.785
- Most of our clothes is
coming from out of the country.

00:01:49.638 --> 00:01:51.755
We lost our manufacturing.

00:01:51.755 --> 00:01:55.505
(slow acoustic guitar music)

